data: {"id": "6a23af3cee9e495a-thinking-parallel_evidence-2502", "run_id": "6a23af3cee9e495a", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "Let me analyze all the evidence collected for the Pod `aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-5mlnc`:\n\n## 实体身份确认\n- **Pod**: workload-5f4fb9ff45-5mlnc (UID: 705925d8-1e60-4c25-8300-62e280589dee)\n- **Namespace**: aiops-case-09\n- **Node**: node2 (10.2.0.50), Pod IP: 172.16.104.16\n- **Container**: app, image: `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`, command: `python3 /opt/aiops/server.py`\n- **控制器**: Deployment/workload → ReplicaSet/workload-5f4fb9ff45\n- **Service**: workload (172.30.17.7)\n-", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 5, "ts_ms": 1789094087890, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

